<h2 class='heading'>What are CSS variables?</h2>
<hr>
<p class='text'>CSS variables (more formerly known as custom properties) are standardised values such as specific colours and numbers which can be reused throughout a project. We use CSS variables
  all over the website in several areas, ensuring that pk-gov's design is as consistent as possible.
</p>

